{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ParticleInteractions.positron_correction","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.positron_correction","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.positron_correction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.positron_correction","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/positron_correction.lean#L57-L73","doc":"**Corrected `Q`-value identity (derived).**\n\n`Q = Σ_char · m_e + m_e`, where the `+m_e` is the positron action\n`(m_{e⁺}/m_e)·m_e = 1·m_e`.  Derived from the structural form\n`Q = (Σ_char + r)·m_e` and `r = 1` by ring algebra — not a projection. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:positron-correction","label":"prop:positron-correction","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/positron-correction.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.appliedPositronCorrection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.appliedPositronCorrection","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/positron_correction.lean#L52-L55","doc":"The applied positron correction: `m_e` in a pair-creation regime, else\n`0`.  Definition (not a stored conclusion). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext.decPairCreation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext.decPairCreation","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/positron_correction.lean#L48-L48","doc":"Decidability of the regime predicate (so the `if` is well-formed). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext.is_pair_creation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext.is_pair_creation","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/positron_correction.lean#L46-L46","doc":"Predicate: the current regime is a pair-creation regime. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext.qvalue_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext.qvalue_form","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/positron_correction.lean#L44-L44","doc":"Structural `Q`-value form: `Q = (Σ_char + r)·m_e` — the character sum\nplus the positron-action units, scaled by `m_e`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext.positron_ratio_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext.positron_ratio_one","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/positron_correction.lean#L41-L41","doc":"Physical input: `m_{e⁺}/m_e = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext.r","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext.r","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/positron_correction.lean#L39-L39","doc":"Positron-to-electron mass ratio `r = m_{e⁺}/m_e` (physical input). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext.«Σ_char»","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext.«Σ_char»","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/positron_correction.lean#L37-L37","doc":"The character-sum-derived contribution `Σ_char : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext.Q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext.Q","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/positron_correction.lean#L35-L35","doc":"The Q-value `Q : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext.m_e","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext.m_e","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/positron_correction.lean#L33-L33","doc":"Electron mass `m_e : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/positron_correction.lean#L31-L31","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PositronCorrectionContext","kind":"class","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/positron_correction.lean#L27-L48","doc":"Context for the positron correction.  Carries the categorical character\nsum `Σ_char`, the structural `Q`-value form `Q = (Σ_char + r)·m_e`, and\nthe positron mass-ratio `r = m_{e⁺}/m_e = 1` as *inputs*; the corrected\nidentity and the regime case split are derived. ","signatureChunk":0}]}